          "exampleId": "w:group#e-84f4b71e7aebea4d",
          "text": "They were randomly divided into four groups and exposed to various noise levels in the background, from total silence to 50 decibels(分贝), 70 decibels, and 85 decibels.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-national-b",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国乙卷）",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-national-b:reading-d",
